@startuml mo_auditor
title mo_auditor: Missouri State Auditor audit reports and ratings
start
:SearchAudits, one calendar year at a time (1999 to now);
note right: the unfiltered list stops at the newest 1,000 rows,\na year holds 90-150, a full year is checked against its total
:mo_auditor_reports (the list records verbatim, one shard unit each);
if (summary id, or a rated-looking title since 2012?) then (yes)
  :fetch the Citizens Summary PDF,\nor else the first pages of the full report;
  :find "In the areas audited, the overall performance\nof this entity was <rating>." (page, sentence kept);
  :mo_auditor_ratings (status ok / no_rating_sentence / http error);
else (no: financial statements, monthly reports,\nfollow-ups, before 2012)
  :no PDF read (rating_status not_read);
endif
:dbt staging: dates, links, rating title-cased;
:dbt: entity type (statewide office by title prefix seed,\ncounty by title) and rating_level 4..1 (int_mo_auditor__reports);
:statewide office audits only: officeholder when released,\nfrom fct_office_history -> fct_audit_reports;
note right: a county rating is never attached to a person
stop
@enduml
